      "title": "Letter sounds",
      "body": "ج jeem = j  ·  چ che = ch  ·  ح bari he = h (Arabic loanwords)  ·  خ khe = kh (like Scottish 'loch')  ·  د daal = soft d  ·  ڈ ḍaal = hard d (tongue curled back)  ·  ذ zaal = z (Arabic loanwords)"
    }
